release
*.log
# Tracked deliberately: a real historical scheduler run log, kept as a test
# fixture (runVerify-landed-commit-outranks.test.cjs) so the 1218-fo-01
# false-positive is replayed byte-for-byte, not reconstructed from memory.
!src/main/__tests__/fixtures/*.log
